    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/0a97d84781a94cb7d7a0a63d196934a6.poster.avif?t=1742734518\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/0a97d84781a94cb7d7a0a63d196934a6.webm?t=1742734518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/0a97d84781a94cb7d7a0a63d196934a6.mp4?t=1742734518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>August, the story's protagonist, is devastated and crushed. Happiness and youth are behind, a difficult adult life and an endless stream of problems are ahead. The routine torments August, each new day is similar to the previous one. He has neither a goal nor a dream. Will someone help him?</strong><br><br><strong> Maybe... Family? </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/31e365932c6591a3aaefa1992b045a3f.avif?t=1742734518\" /></span><br><br>August's father is an aggressive and abusive man. He lost contact with his son after the death of August's mother, and no matter how much he tried to restore it, everything was in vain. Every time their conversation turns into a quarrel with broken dishes. And then they try to took the initial step toward reconciliation. Is it possible to find a common ground in their case?<br><br><strong> Or a good old buddy?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/6eaa8342e7e23e2763ff853fd17c532e.avif?t=1742734518\" /></span><br><br>August and Semyon have been best friends for many years. But adult life changed everything, ice appeared between them. And now they are connected only by drinking, gambling and a common trouble \u2013 an empty future. They can fall to the social bottom or hit the jackpot - all ways depend on the will of chance.<br><br><strong> An ex-girlfriend? </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/9e7a1a96085d3f2b654ec00ba6e869c7.avif?t=1742734518\" /></span><br><br>She is August's school dream. The girl he had been happy with all his youth. He wanted to build a future with her, start a family. But mutual misunderstandings did not allow this to come true. Now the feelings are buried, and the only question is whether August will be able to dig them out, because now Chloe needs help.<br><br><strong>Childhood love? <strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/0637ce7eaab852d848f2e1222fe5702c.avif?t=1742734518\" /></span><br><br>Jose. Once a sweet friend of the family, she became a real French hottie. Her flirty smile can charm anyone, and August was no exception. French beauty is full of energy, goals and aspirations. And August has a chance to restore their relationship, turn a childhood crush into adult love. Is it possible for him to stay on the wave of adventures?<br><br><strong> Next-door girl? </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/a12e657c95eab393a7009c9b5010d729.avif?t=1742734518\" /></span><br><br>Alena appeared in August's life as quickly as she disappeared. A mysterious girl who wants to make friends with the main character, but constantly keeps something back. Or are there so many skeletons in her closet that there is no other choice? In any case, August will have to solve the main question \u2014 whether he can trust a charming, but very ambiguous girl.<br><br><strong> But August has something special inside... </strong><br><br><strong> A feeling of deja-vu.</strong><br><br>This girl\u2026 What was her name?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/d671568dbd93dae5060675371634eb97.poster.avif?t=1742734518\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/d671568dbd93dae5060675371634eb97.webm?t=1742734518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/d671568dbd93dae5060675371634eb97.mp4?t=1742734518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong> Maybe it all happened once before? </strong><br><br><br><strong><u>Project Features:</u></strong><br><br><strong>- Unique visual style</strong>: beautiful CG art, dozens of variations of sprites, a variety of backgrounds.<br><br><strong>- A large number of choices in the game</strong>: time-based choices, item-based choices, and more than 15 endings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/717784025e0fe5c9aff44f2aa11a8592.avif?t=1742734518\" /></span><br><br><strong>- Code features</strong>: parallax effect, point-and-click elements with full-fledged walking through locations, equipment, item search, phone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/b1346202f0abd77bb46017ccbd2b4310.poster.avif?t=1742734518\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/b1346202f0abd77bb46017ccbd2b4310.webm?t=1742734518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/b1346202f0abd77bb46017ccbd2b4310.mp4?t=1742734518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>- Additional games</strong>: lock breaking, card games, shooting gallery, QTE, in-game computer and many others.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/93f548438b22c57eead9d0794cc1b9a8.avif?t=1742734518\" /></span><br><br><strong>- Original soundtrack</strong> by Denis Osterman.<br><br><strong>- Several hundred compositions and sound effects</strong> in the full version of the game, striving for cinematic sound.<br><br><strong>We are planning 3 chapters.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/13297e118d3308262e3c83b28c4853a1.poster.avif?t=1742734518\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/13297e118d3308262e3c83b28c4853a1.webm?t=1742734518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413580/extras/13297e118d3308262e3c83b28c4853a1.mp4?t=1742734518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>The release of Chapter 1 is aimed at 2024-2025.</strong></strong></strong>",
